--- request to POST https://api.anthropic.com/v1/messages
{
  "model": "claude-opus-5-5",
  "max_tokens": 1024,
  "tools": [
    {
      "name": "get_book",
      "description": "Look up one book in the Harbor Books catalog by its ID. Returns title, author, format, price in cents, and copies in stock. Read-only.",
      "input_schema": {
        "type": "object",
        "properties": {
          "book_id": {
            "type": "string",
            "description": "Harbor book ID, such as bk-1001",
            "pattern": "^bk-[0-9]{4}$"
          }
        },
        "required": [
          "book_id"
        ]
      }
    }
  ],
  "messages": [
    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "Is bk-1001 in stock, and what does it cost?"
    }
  ]
}
--- response
{
  "id": "msg_standin_0001",
  "type": "message",
  "role": "assistant",
  "model": "local-standin",
  "content": [
    {
      "type": "tool_use",
      "id": "toolu_standin_0001",
      "name": "get_book",
      "input": {
        "book_id": "bk-1001"
      }
    }
  ],
  "stop_reason": "tool_use"
}
--- tool_result to send back to the model
{
  "type": "tool_result",
  "tool_use_id": "toolu_standin_0001",
  "content": "{\"id\": \"bk-1001\", \"title\": \"Moby-Dick\", \"author\": \"Herman Melville\", \"first_published\": 1851, \"format\": \"paperback\", \"price_cents\": 1499, \"currency\": \"USD\", \"in_stock\": 7}",
  "is_error": false
}
